      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-openapi-diff.mjs old.json new.json\nnode bin/dsh-openapi-diff.mjs old.json new.json --json\n```\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse openapi_diff with old=old.json new=new.json.\n```"
